  "body": "This is a very small text error.\r\n\r\nIn [6.5.2 Data model](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#focusable-area), in the Examples table, one of the criteria is:\r\n  \"the element is not **not** expressly inert;\"\r\nNote the double-not. I think this should just be a single \"not\".",
